{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:71b3eaf6a3b5d21d4395de0aa2fb65f17428c568270091d57371d480bfd6653e",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611a56144cfb4579df016ddfcc8509e5de01c12e7ec4b0f83f2b2bc2f6fa6835",
      "text": "房间show time☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ab960bc80dd03d2876be651145ce091b63c436a4ac18d1178879d8acd15cc11",
      "text": "类的房间将在电视节目中被介绍。\n制作人事先提议打扫房间，\n但因某个原因改变了想法。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:611a56144cfb4579df016ddfcc8509e5de01c12e7ec4b0f83f2b2bc2f6fa6835",
      "text": "房间show time☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000023:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:01ddbe418d6c91373c63455357523b677c345c881854d287c323be7bdd3c26e5",
      "text": "How are you doing，●●●●プロデューサー酱！\n我带伴手礼来了哦♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000026:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2e73ff6a8180d0facf9b5a19e1c0c8aed64c34a1e478aeb6ba6c14aeb2db1faf",
      "text": "伴手礼？\n去哪里旅行了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b5927aabd1ac1d518580a72bae8dd6bfa206baba130198ebde81a4b7a032fbf0",
      "text": "不是，正好路过百货商场的时候\n看到在办物产展。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:17e03f561d3e3de3093cbcfd78c059f8e21069b07cc762f8e690ab825e499358",
      "text": "看起来很好吃就买来了。\n和我一起have a break吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000042:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4079614a4a9005fa63d8f502d4ba319cdefda3083c66393fb647d9df6bbb1190",
      "text": "好啊！我正好也想和类先生\n聊聊工作的事呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:386cd282345a23f9df03ef6f289f3d066af255ff33183a422e71b5e249fc4eba",
      "text": "Great！一石二鸟呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8b8fc393c5a329af08987b88aa2e9310082499c448e5f835cf4a518fde62af1",
      "text": "说起来类先生，\n那张照片拍好带过来了吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1b442f75e66bbc0570a7cf5f7e8b039abfeceafc94b37769d7ca5a1a4bcc7ffe",
      "text": "那张照片？什么来着？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:73d435ad1ce24638e4ead15ee6a896e06e01589f77f68d574572d74ccf11190b",
      "text": "就是在《偶像的住宅访问！》这个电视节目里\n要用到的照片呀。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_a:cmd-000076:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ad06304538810b427012d849457f6d563b966f9c66b898883a544fd9366e6839",
      "text": "因为节目要播出类先生的房间，\n所以之前拜托您拍了照片……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000016:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40912f07ca8ac43d06c47a0d6372aa1ec3558aa6f4fc8861064b76f39fb9ba57",
      "text": "Ah！是那件事啊。\nOf course，我记得哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de1903bcfc6bce7406570ad3b4ab6ee0f21f4dacfe908925ac1813276d8b0136",
      "text": "为了不忘记，\n被拜托的当天晚上我就拍了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:919e564c39b2481fd5cd42cbaa5ace7cefa80b3bfd0b4e8331d73ea9752fbfa3",
      "text": "等等哦，马上拿给你看。\n打开相册文件夹，然后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000036:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ab0dfbb1fc5e135b1065a79fc6f7fc683e3693f9764f799f6f0be7c319f46491",
      "text": "Let me see……给，请看☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:27e2fc8b3c6fedcf16641c97b73e58a0c47cf71a819f865d5a34829c62ef78e4",
      "text": "谢谢。\n我马上看看。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8720eaccdde2cac2d63316f5e0d21adf05ca24aad792317a5702bfd5da50edc5",
      "text": "这、这是……！\n该说是有个性呢，还是说东西堆得好乱呢……？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c949c22ec361668f53b7d9973b717079f655b5857bfadffeb062e3e400987ea7",
      "text": "会吗？我倒不觉得呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f97d0309c12807f7de5b65cb1959a1183ff93e16a3b26ff2060ef5b9f85840a3",
      "text": "不过和Mr. 硲还有Mr. 山下的房间\n比起来，东西可能稍微有点多呢☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000062:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e8ff373d37a4a035a16a4d31f243688eb6f9904d76cde002130ab3eae665e70c",
      "text": "（……怎、怎么办？把这个房间\n原封不动播出去可能不太妙吧……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_b:cmd-000066:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:643c8fe1b9f9c0e2bcc3fc99ba5e493faf14e4cff5af31477a820d00712b2a91",
      "text": "……那个，类先生。我想和你商量一下……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000012:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000023:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cbd5792d93a08ffb8e71d3111992edffe857d3f4833152ce3ec39af0a76a7fb5",
      "text": "类的家",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000033:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:22eee3b617d51c07143f4ea53752d53a5531bb977c7a3e72a1a829d1a3f1a01b",
      "text": "Welcome！欢迎光临●●●●プロデューサー酱。\n这里就是我的房间哦☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ec76a9e3615b2fd673d97a57d327569c0665e307c7f004a94bdb6761edc64657",
      "text": "打扰了。\n突然说想整理房间，真是不好意思。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000044:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:55aa0b7f31e615c8961afded6882a48c846e0ec8004ae3e076c379e0636d6eb8",
      "text": "No problem！非常欢迎哦。\n特意为了我过来一趟，thanks♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000047:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:824963b99312354ab5051ceb009eb64fd7337c01f66d3d3721de9b1ff37c973a",
      "text": "（比照片上看到的还要乱得多啊。\n得打起精神好好收拾了……！）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000050:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44803099b1f6b92a707b3582de99a8c8770b026571c7a8df2b90dc40d90bf78e",
      "text": "那么我们这就开始吧。我来整理书架，\n类先生就负责整理壁橱，拜托了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000053:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:3281f9f76c8ce7bcfe413e249e33dbdf3793c3444db2e4ca92d61250299ef3d4",
      "text": "OK，包在我身上☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:671347f1db7b0472989490c11adf4916a16b9d1a5f6c1dbf1726b9b787d175d1",
      "text": "……啊。快看，●●●●プロデューサー酱！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0422009e0447c3657519797032b3ca95fc03de3cba7096a27d92a9b04e33dc56",
      "text": "这条领带是大学时代的前辈送给我的哦，\n不觉得very cool吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000091:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d0d354dc38bb70e277affffacbc05e3d1aa71fed1d9cb10cf9139cd5759222af",
      "text": "Wow！这个是和friends买的同款\nhat！怎么样，合适吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_c:cmd-000095:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6e6d505baf683fa402e52e24b3b75703e109434d3d67c7e7da96ab6b45484cd1",
      "text": "啊哈哈。对类先生来说，\n哪一件都装满了回忆呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1282fb0749cbac924d5553215a79a50c04358bee7dca4290c1928ab6a6e2d717",
      "text": "（……对我来说就算只是平平无奇的东西，\n对类先生来说也全都是特别的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:710b0ab8fe437affe09b35405d647d033267fbe36ff61b057d858ff21b33f43c",
      "text": "（这里有太多他的回忆了。\n这个房间，正是舞田类这位偶像本身）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000018:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d2b6687e84f29a084648b5a85a5da3d43b3d076ca480056bf1f20bae6a1cc919",
      "text": "（去改变这一切，\n说不定反而是一种错误……）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000029:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:548c1e79e3a90f6d6581fdd326a51de6fbe6c11421fd129934286b8e6c60dad5",
      "text": "类先生，不好意思。\n这次的节目播出，果然还是……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000045:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2a40248a047b34eca4002dcdf855823097e67ae97e2d83de4a83373b48f972a",
      "text": "数周后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:84938e01bd9f4ab45e32959e4342fa984950ec3bebc8ded5e6fca3334665e16a",
      "text": "啊……终于开播了呢，\n《偶像的住宅访问！》",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000063:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1122298ed3de732fafe243e5a92ceba173c139285a5844d43fb9db9b998a6373",
      "text": "是之前录制的那期节目呢！\n演播室里的大家当时好像都被我的房间吓到了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000067:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a295fcd89536e6600d1a1e09b251a2d46a0f6034f0f34e8807012e83e0aceb95",
      "text": "是啊。不过大家都表示很能理解呢。\n说这充分体现了类先生的性格。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:40dbe6a5ee7e715712f4d0e99f1de1321b373f61fb8d92901ed2139582b4f974",
      "text": "Yeah！东西堆得满满的，热热闹闹的，\n大家都夸这真是地地道道的“舞田Room”呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000079:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e1eb6adfa71375daf9b9cc1106b37e184d5f6e9f6c365729fc8f6cb2ae4b0506",
      "text": "毕竟是我看惯了的房间，\n我自己倒是没觉得有什么特别的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_d:cmd-000085:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:87c0da2ced0058c6152b6b44b684b7948b8a765bc2d8faf8bb0d2975bc7f317c",
      "text": "粉丝们会给出\n怎样的反应呢，好期待呀☆",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "数日后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:186bb2ac821c2941bbd8c7e21d86f8aa3290b666962af887eaea5c0843ce57e4",
      "text": "类先生。粉丝们寄来的\n信件和礼物已经送到了哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a9df240b01c4b24bd349f68bffb08d91cf1f7132edc7e3fb85b7c1205a79195f",
      "text": "Oh，数量好惊人啊！\n不过，怎么会突然送这么多？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2fbaa1fd58283360484f38723674ea488efdf3b97f9eed4d474c4622a514e73f",
      "text": "看来是前几天播出的\n电视节目的反响呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:004ee7ac0f9fa35ada3610e09fef2a8854d3f599fe7e79cc0e24ac72d178c1f9",
      "text": "电视节目……Ah！是家访的那期吧♪",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2e52192e80172b69fe425854f00711ea69e2929da06df6763f8add41d211c10",
      "text": "……真的耶。\nLetter上面写着呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a8a7642954edcdccead1e1bfa3f33bd689c111b91d33751ec21311075fe21648",
      "text": "“我做了一个S.E.M的毛线玩偶，\n如果可以的话请摆在房间里装饰吧”，这么说的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96ddffeafc7cf756b7126feaf5ef54afaa736819fe079274db10d7a84d197a0",
      "text": "这边好像还寄来了一些\n方便收纳整理的实用好物。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:31032d305d0858db0aa8606be1107fbe7ccd109a8ee26d6ee37c19ea79579d3b",
      "text": "Wow……太开心了！\n我要全～部装饰在房间里！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000077:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:03537d4be1f1356fd749746467991b2d321b21a8ffed5d41d50ed716f38e3eff",
      "text": "没想到大学毕业之后，\n还能收到这么多礼物……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_036rui_01_1_2_036_01:1_2_036_01_e:cmd-000084:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:9308150f09314d3469e21e1b987a38b4fa639559d2195df7ee6f9518f84ee755",
      "text": "啊哈。总觉得心里满满当当的！\n能成为偶像，真是so happy！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
